            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "lNXwe",
              "name": "Group note",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The repository's own column (CH4–CH6, CH42) is gone, and so is the setting that chose it. On a computer the open place's row is marked current in the sidebar, as any other current row, with nothing under it: the header's tabs move between a repository's sections or a project's saved views. Only the phone's places panel expands a place into them (App · Mobile, MB270, MB271). The header keeps its tabs while they fit, drawn as one bordered tab group with a tooltip naming each tab's key (CH67), and gives way in steps as the window narrows (App · Toolbar, CH75–CH79). The title carries the sidebar's icon, lock or book, inside the title button right before the name, instead of the word \"private\".",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
