              "name": "Group note",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "An issue or pull request the menu finds takes two lines, cut from the list row (the List row components): line 1 the kind-and-state icon, the title with the match marked and its age; line 2, smaller and dim, the reference, where it stands as the list row says it (one combined fact when all is well, failing checks on their own before the standing), an issue's project field and the author's avatar. Actions and places stay one line.",
