                      "name": "Caption note",
                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Typing \"cal\" in a project. Each found issue or pull request is the desktop list row cut to its basic facts: line 1 the kind-and-state icon, the title with the match marked and its age right after it; line 2, smaller and dim, the reference, where it stands as the list row's status says it (\"Approved · checks passed\" as one fact; a draft's \"1 check failing\" on its own, then \"Draft\"), an issue's project field (dot, value, \"+1\") and the author's avatar (none for your own). Actions and places stay one line.",
