                      "content": "The open project's menu lists its saved views with their keys, as R4 lists a repository's sections: 1 to 9 in the views' order, none for a tenth and later, the current view checked, the cloud where GitHub answers the filter. Open goes, since the project is already open. Only the open project's menu has the views: right-clicking another project in the sidebar (R3) shows its menu without them, as its keys would act on the project shown.",
