                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "C from anywhere. The repository is pre-filled with the one used last; the cursor is in the title. Everything else is an optional chip. Enter creates and closes, and a toast offers Create another and Open (H10).",
