              "content": "On the first launch after the version changed, in the bottom right corner, above the status bar. A brief toast (App · Toasts): it goes by itself after 6 seconds, not while hovered or focused, and the indigo ring around its × shows how long is left; the changelog in Settings: Updates keeps what it says. Only ever a toast: no window opens by itself (D7). ⌥W opens Updates and is a command in ⌘K while the toast shows.",
