                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "You work in more repositories than ever, and with agents on the job, all of them are moving at once. GitHub gives each one its own pages. githq gives you one list: what’s waiting for your review, what’s ready to merge, what broke on main and what’s assigned to you.",
