              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "1200 × 630 (og:image, twitter:summary_large_image) and 1280 × 640 (GitHub repository social preview). Everything important sits inside the central safe area — X and Slack crop to ~1.91:1, iMessage and LinkedIn round the corners and can trim a few pixels off each edge. Headline stays ≥ 56 px so it reads in a 500 px wide feed card. The app in each image is built from the components, as the landing's hero picture (Sidebar / expanded with broken workflows marked, List pane / My work, and in B the pull request panel), so it follows the app.",
