                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The panel dragged to 1300 px, Direction D's two-column width for an item in the panel. Runs on the left with their filters and the Group control (None by default); the workflow's details on the right: triggers, the refs that count, last success and typical duration, dispatch inputs, the file and its state. The Run workflow button has no key: it opens the dispatch form in the command menu (W37). Below 1300 px the same content splits into the tabs Runs and Details (W32, W42). The edge between the runs and the details is a splitter, drawn here hovered (2 px accent): at rest a 1 px line in the colour of the runs' separators, which end on it, so the two columns read apart. Dragging it, or ←/→ on the focused edge, sets the details from 320 to 640 px, 400 by default, kept on this device.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
