                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The Group control at the end of the runs' toolbar opens the same grouping menu as the lists (J2): None (the default), Status, Ref, Event, Day, Actor. Status chosen: In progress, Failed, Succeeded, Cancelled, each with its count over the runs read so far. Groups fold like any list's; here Succeeded is folded, so the one cancelled run is in view. Grouping is one setting for every workflow, saved with the settings, so it follows the user between computers when saving settings to GitHub is on. The filters (Ref, Event, Status, Actor) are different: they clear when another workflow opens.",
