                      "content": "CLA, which GitHub starts on pull requests only, on its Details tab (the panel narrower than 1300 px). Only pull requests have run it, so the head says what the Workflows list says: the pill reads “Pull requests only”, muted with a pull-request icon, and “never counts” follows it. No Run workflow button in the head and no dispatch inputs. The pull_request trigger reads “any pull request” with the hint every pull_request trigger has, “Never counts”; main, the ref that counts, says “No runs on a branch yet”. The command menu disables Run workflow here, as the file has no workflow_dispatch (W48).",
