                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "W3a with the keys of the navigation model. ↵ opens the workflow in the panel beside the list (W30, W32), not a run, so every row opens the same way, passing or broken; ↵ again on the open row, or ⇧↵ straight from the list, opens it full screen (W31). F opens the latest failed run of the workflow under the cursor, on whatever ref it failed, and replaces W3b's “Other runs →”: the runs no longer unfold under the row, they live in the workflow. On a workflow without a failure F does nothing and its hint is dimmed. The same jump is the command Open latest failure.",
