                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "After picking Deploy the menu keeps its place and becomes a short form, under the crumbs ▷ Run workflow › Deploy (reached straight from Run workflow · Deploy, the crumb is the workflow alone, without ▷): the ref first, the default branch already chosen, then the inputs from the workflow file in its order, each with its type and default. Tab and ⇧Tab move between rows; a choice opens its options on Enter or ↑↓; a boolean flips on Space. ⌘Enter or the Run button in the footer runs, Esc steps back to the list of workflows. When the workflow can't run at the ref typed, a line under the fields says why and the ref stays editable. Here environment and version were changed and dry_run switched off.",
