                      "name": "Explanation",
                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "githq creates a private repository named githq-settings in your account, with one file: your settings. Another computer can then load them. githq has no server and keeps nothing about you; the data is yours, in your repository. Leave this off and nothing leaves this device.",
