                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "LQE6F",
                      "name": "Caption title",
                      "fill": "$fg",
                      "content": "SP54 · In the queue, won't merge",
                      "fontFamily": "$font",
                      "fontSize": 15,
                      "fontWeight": "500"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "NDFKL",
                      "name": "Caption note",
                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "A stack in the queue reads as a single pull request does (PM15, PM16): the group's place is the first one's, each row its own. Take out of queue goes to the first open one and takes all of them out. With no entry it's an ordinary stack (SP53): GitHub doesn't say why an entry left, so neither does githq.",
