                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Red twice and nowhere else: the centre of the commit's dot in the graph, inside a ring in its lane's colour (CH61), and the red ✕ right after its pull request. The headline stays in its usual colour. Running is amber in both places, an amber centre in the dot; passing is a quiet green check; no checks, nothing. The pull request and the CI mark sit right after the headline on line 1, so they are read with it; the author, the age and the sha follow on line 2.",
