                      "id": "glxYV",
                      "name": "Caption note",
                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The hover and the selection light the whole row, the graph column included: the surface starts 4 px in from the pane's left edge and ends 8 px before its right, radius 6, and the lanes are drawn over it, unbroken from row to row. The commit's dot gets a 16 px ring, 3.5 px out from a plain dot's edge and 1.5 px clear of a failing or running dot's outline (CH61): on hover a soft one, $fg-3 at 50%; on the selection a clear one in $accent. Both 1.5 px. The ring sits under the lanes, so a line passing through the dot still reads. Commit row carries the surface and the ring, so every screen with a selected commit now shows it this way.",
