                      "content": "nuxt/nuxt has 67 branches and 339 tags; typing is the way to the rest. \"3.1\" matches across both groups. The testing folder, folded until now, unfolds on its own around its four matches, which show their full names; folders without a match hide. A level still draws 20 entries while filtering, and ends with the same Show N more row as without a filter, here under Tags: the folder and 19 tags, then Show 15 more. Clearing the filter folds testing again and goes back to 20 per level.",
