                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "eiGXN",
                      "name": "Caption note",
                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Each group header carries its own sort: a small outlined button naming the order in words, Newest first or By name, with a chevron. A click, or ↵ on it, opens a menu of the two with a check on the current one; ↑/↓ and ↵ pick, Esc closes. Branches and Tags sort apart and both start at Newest first. The order is a user preference kept in the synced settings: one choice for Branches and one for Tags, the same in every repository. By name keeps the rule of CH53: folders first, then loose refs, each A to Z, inside folders too, numbers compared as numbers, so hld-9 < hld-98 < hld-99 < hld-100. The default branch stays on top either way, and folding is kept. Filtering keeps the order.",
