                      "name": "Caption note",
                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Right after the commit arrives from git, before GitHub has answered for its pull request and checks. Both groups hold an empty bar, the same `Commit / Not known yet` the commit rows show, sized like the line that will replace it, so nothing jumps when the answer lands. Parents and refs come with the commit and show at once. The ⇧↵ key appears with the pull request.",
