              "content": "A comment on a line or a range, a reply, resolving, and sending a review. ⌘↵ does what you chose in Settings; ⌘⇧↵ does the other, and the buttons say exactly what each will do. While your draft is open, GitHub takes nothing else from you on that pull request, so the second key adds the comment and sends the whole draft (D17, D22).",
