                      "content": "GitHub's seven syntax colours, grouped as in highlight.js's github-dark theme, each AA over the window and over a deleted or an added line: comments grey, keywords red, strings light blue, constants blue, titles purple, tags green, built-ins orange; the rest the line's own colour. Only colour changes, so no line's height does. Variables syntax-*. D37.",
