              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The sidebar shows the description, reviews and comments with the pull request's own cards, in their narrow layout when the column is narrow, with the same ⋯ menu, the same sending and refused states and editing in place. Replies inside code threads stay flat. The column is resizable from its inner edge: 340 px by default and at least, kept on this device.",
