                          "content": "\"cal\" typed over a project's list, the keyboard down (D16). The whole list runs upwards, so the best match, Calendar shows wrong timezone…, sits right above the input. A found issue or pull request takes two lines: the kind-and-state icon and the title on one line, cut short; then the reference, the short standing as the phone's list row says it, the project field, the author's avatar and the age. E11 on the desktop.",
