                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "The three filters sit in a strip under the top bar, the first choice on every visit; the command line's chip names My work and how many rows the filter shows. Rows: type, title on up to two lines, then the repository without its owner when it is tracked, the row field (\"In progress +1\"), labels as colour dots, and for a pull request its checks and review. Names of labels, milestones and assignees other than one avatar are only in the item.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.45,
                              "fontFamily": "$font",
                              "fontSize": 13,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
