                              "content": "Edit turns the card into the desktop's editor where it stands, with its text at 16 px, Write and Preview, and the formatting tools as 44 px targets: bold and italic, the rest behind ⋯. The keyboard rises and the thread scrolls so the card's buttons stay above it; the command line steps aside. Update comment saves it and the head then says “· edited”; if GitHub refuses, a toast says so and the editor opens again with your text.",
