                              "content": "Tapping the comment box grows it into the desktop's composer, made of its parts: Close issue and Comment on top, the text at 16 px (iOS zooms into a field with smaller text), then Write, Preview and the formatting tools just above the keyboard (D51), each a 44 px target: bold, italic, code, link, and ⋯ for the rest. Comment is dim until there is text. ⌘ steps aside (D18). No key hints on a phone.",
