                              "content": "Adding is a step apart from the tracked list, as on the computer (T18): + on Repositories (MB151) or a group's Track more opens the first sign-in's choosing screen as a screen of its own, back to Repositories, typing as MB163–MB164. Tracked repositories show a grey fixed tick and \"tracked\"; an owner whose every repository is tracked folds to its header. Nothing changes until Track 2 repositories; back drops the picks without asking. The tracked list and each repository's own settings stay where they are (MB151 → MB152).",
                              "lineHeight": 1.45,
                              "fontFamily": "$font",
                              "fontSize": 13,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
