                              "content": "Draft issue is the first entry of the Repository menu whenever the issue starts in a project (MB210): the same form, the Repository row reading Draft in Platform Q4. A draft has a title, a body, assignees and the project's fields, so only Assignees and the project's card are shown: no labels, milestone, type or parent. Converting it to an issue happens on GitHub for now.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.45,
                              "fontFamily": "$font",
                              "fontSize": 13,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
